  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="01:00.110" end="01:07.830" ttm:agent="v1">If it's love that you want, I'll give my everything</p>
      <p begin="01:07.830" end="01:10.990" ttm:agent="v1">And have I made the right assumption?</p>
